    "stdout": "T008 : ∀ (n m : ℕ) (u : Space n × ↑(Set.Ioi 0) → Value m) (q : Value m),\n  UnitValued (ubar u q) →\n    (FirstCalculus (ubar u q) ∧\n        SecondCalculus (ubar u q) ∧\n          ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun p => density (ubar u q) p.1 p.2) {p | 0 < p.2} ∧\n            ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun p => densityRate (ubar u q) p.1 p.2) {p | 0 < p.2} ∧\n              (∀ (x : Space n) (t : ℝ),\n                  0 < t → HasDerivAt (fun r => density (ubar u q) x r) (densityRate (ubar u q) x t) t) ∧\n                (∀ (j : Fin n) (x : Space n) (t : ℝ),\n                    0 < t →\n                      ∀ (k : Fin m),\n                        (fderiv ℝ (fun y => ubar u q (y, t) k) x) (Pi.single j 1) = spatial (ubar u q) j x t k ∧\n                          (fderiv ℝ (fun y => velocity (ubar u q) y t k) x) (Pi.single j 1) = mixed (ubar u q) j x t k ∧\n                            (fderiv ℝ (fun y => spatial (ubar u q) j y t k) x) (Pi.single j 1) =\n                              spatialSecond (ubar u q) j x t k) ∧\n                  (∀ (x : Space n) (t : ↑(Set.Ioi 0)), ubar u q (x, ↑t) = u (x, t)) ∧\n                    ∀ (x : Space n), ∀ t ≤ 0, ubar u q (x, t) = q) →\n      ∀ (x : Space n) (t : ℝ),\n        0 < t →\n          dot (ubar u q (x, t)) (velocity (ubar u q) x t) = 0 ∧ dot (velocity (ubar u q) x t) (ubar u q (x, t)) = 0\n'Translation.T008' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n",
